{
  "version": "0.9.1",
  "notes": "Automatic hybrid compute setup: XemAi discovers an online Qwen worker on the private Tailscale network, pairs it automatically, and keeps the existing host as fallback. On the worker PC, setup waits for Tailscale and an installed Qwen model, then requests Windows administrator approval once to configure private Tailscale Serve and login autostart. No URL or token copying is needed. Both PCs must update to v0.9.1, use the same Tailscale network, and already have Ollama with a Qwen model on the worker PC.",
